['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C.\n####\n# Context:\nBob is kind. Bob is round. Charlie is rough. Erin is green. Erin is rough. Erin is round. Gary is cold. All rough people are green. If someone is green then they are white. If someone is white then they are not big. If someone is green and not big then they are kind. If someone is kind and not big then they are round.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or unknown? Gary is kind.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Unknown']
