['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C.\n####\n# Context:\nBob is big. Bob is green. Dave is kind. Dave is white. Erin is green. Erin is kind. Erin is smart. Fiona is big. Fiona is blue. Fiona is furry. White, blue things are furry. All big, white things are smart. Furry things are green. Kind things are blue. All green things are furry. Green things are big.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or unknown? Dave is not furry.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Unknown']
