ement19, the lion would need the squirrel. But the problem states the bald eagle needs the lion, but there\'s no conflict with the lion needing the squirrel. So that\'s allowed.\n\nAlternatively, maybe the squirrel\'s visit to the lion would require the lion to need the squirrel, but since the problem doesn\'t say the lion does need the squirrel, but also doesn\'t say it doesn\'t, so that\'s possible either way.\n\nTherefore, the answer must be unknown (C).\n'] 73%|███████▎  | 440/600 [13:46:37<4:41:21, 105.51s/it]
