t she must be round. \n3. **Implications of Fiona Being Round:** \n   - By Rule 5 (\"If someone is nice and round, then they are rough\"), Fiona would also have to be rough. \n   - This does not conflict with her known attributes (blue, nice, smart), as roughness is not listed but inferred. \n4. **Checking for Contradictions:** \n   - Fiona\u2019s smartness aligns with Rule 2 (\"All rough people are smart\") if she is rough. \n   - Rule 3 (\"If someone is blue and rough, they are smart\") also holds, as Fiona is blue and rough (inferred), so her smartness is consistent. \n5. **Conclusion:** Fiona must be round due to Rule 8. The statement \"Fiona is not round\" is therefore **false**.\n\n**Answer:** B) False",
